=== D-type sector (nu = 1/2, N = L/2 odd): omega_1(L) = lowest support at q = 2pi/L, and the q = pi edge ===
  U=0 (control)     : omega_1 = [np.float64(1.0), np.float64(0.38197), np.float64(0.19806)]  local z_P' = [1.884, 1.952]  omega(q=pi) = [np.float64(4.0), np.float64(4.0), np.float64(4.0)]
  U=1               : omega_1 = [np.float64(1.28156), np.float64(0.6603), np.float64(0.4441)]  local z_P' = [1.298, 1.179]  omega(q=pi) = [np.float64(2.92477), np.float64(1.87305), np.float64(1.36007)]
  U=4               : omega_1 = [np.float64(1.71735), np.float64(1.01308), np.float64(0.71867)]  local z_P' = [1.033, 1.02]  omega(q=pi) = [np.float64(2.62052), np.float64(1.6918), np.float64(1.23244)]
  U=inf (hard-core) : omega_1 = [np.float64(2.0), np.float64(1.23607), np.float64(0.89008)]  local z_P' = [0.942, 0.976]  omega(q=pi) = [np.float64(2.0), np.float64(1.23607), np.float64(0.89008)]
  U=0: z=2, no soft point at pi (free-boson collapse).  U>0: z -> 1 and omega(q=pi) -> 0 (Lieb II / 2k_F soft point)

=== E-type sector (fixed N = 3, L grows): interaction cannot generate an IR velocity at vanishing density ===
  U=0 (control)     : omega_1 = [np.float64(1.0), np.float64(0.381966), np.float64(0.198062)]  local z_P' = [1.884, 1.952]  (-> 2)
  U=4               : omega_1 = [np.float64(1.717349), np.float64(0.758277), np.float64(0.42922)]  local z_P' = [1.6, 1.691]  (-> 2)
  U=inf (hard-core) : omega_1 = [np.float64(2.0), np.float64(1.0), np.float64(0.554958)]  local z_P' = [1.357, 1.75]  (-> 2)

