=== Bogoliubov (mean-field, weak U; exact in d >= 2 condensates, NOT the 1D exact answer) ===
  n=0.5: q=0.2: omega_B = 0.203608  n=0.5: q=0.1: omega_B = 0.100456  n=0.5: q=0.05: omega_B = 0.050057
  n=0.0: q=0.2: omega_B = 0.039867  n=0.0: q=0.1: omega_B = 0.009992  n=0.0: q=0.05: omega_B = 0.002499
  finite n: omega_B ~ sqrt(2Un) q (z=1) with soft set {0} only -> class (1,1); n -> 0: omega_B -> eps_q (z=2), class (2,1)
